{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-2177","published":"2026-05-03T11:11:09Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:19:50.636197140Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-35177"],"summary":"vim security update","details":"Vim is an advanced text editor that seeks to provide the power of the de-facto Unix editor &amp;apos;Vi&amp;apos;, with a more complete feature set. Vim is a highly configurable text editor built to enable efficient text editing. It is an improved version of the vi editor distributed with most UNIX systems.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nVim is an open source, command line text editor. Prior to 9.2.0280, a path traversal bypass in Vim&apos;s zip.vim plugin allows overwriting of arbitrary files when opening specially crafted zip archives, circumventing the previous fix for CVE-2025-53906. This vulnerability is fixed in 9.2.0280.(CVE-2026-35177)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"vim","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP1","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/vim&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP1"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"9.0.2092-31.oe2403sp1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["vim-X11-9.0.2092-31.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","vim-common-9.0.2092-31.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","vim-debuginfo-9.0.2092-31.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","vim-debugsource-9.0.2092-31.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","vim-enhanced-9.0.2092-31.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm","vim-minimal-9.0.2092-31.oe2403sp1.aarch64.rpm"],"noarch":["vim-filesystem-9.0.2092-31.oe2403sp1.noarch.rpm"],"src":["vim-9.0.2092-31.oe2403sp1.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["vim-X11-9.0.2092-31.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","vim-common-9.0.2092-31.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","vim-debuginfo-9.0.2092-31.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","vim-debugsource-9.0.2092-31.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","vim-enhanced-9.0.2092-31.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm","vim-minimal-9.0.2092-31.oe2403sp1.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-2177.json"}},{"package":{"name":"vim","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP3","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/vim